Data Element: ZCATEG_DE
Domain: ZCATEG_DOMAIN

Semantic meaning:
Defines the category of an equipment.
The category is used to classify equipment by technical domain
(electrical, mechanical, digital, HVAC, safety) and can be used
to drive validations, UI behavior, or reporting logic.

Used in:
- Table ZEQUIPMENT (field CATEGORY)
- Equipment RAP Business Object
- CDS views for Equipment
